msgctxt "#30054"
msgid "Gamepad: Paddle Response (Analog)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30055"
msgid "Determines how the speed of the paddle varies when tilting the RetroPad analog stick. 'Linear': Speed is directly proportional to analog stick displacement. 'Quadratic': Speed increases quadratically with analog stick displacement; this allows for greater precision when making small movements without sacrificing maximum speed at full analog range. Applies when input device type is set to 'Gamepad'."
msgstr ""

