msgid "Gamepad: Paddle Deadzone (Analog)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30059"
msgid "Sets the deadzone of the RetroPad analog sticks. Used to eliminate drift/unwanted input when emulating analog paddle movement. Applies when input device type is set to 'Gamepad'."
msgstr ""

